Please rename all table columns names to have a Pascal Case and all table names to have Pascal + Sncake case wih naming ocnvention t_[Pascale_Snake_Case]

Also remove all uniqueidentifier column types, we use regular BIGINT with IDENTITY column on all tables
Dont't use UTC dates, use regular DATETIME that will be populated  with GETDATE()

Also add these audit columns on all these tables (And if there is tables using columns other audit columns, replace them with these) 

	[CreatedBy] [nvarchar](255) NOT NULL,
	[CreatedDate] [datetime] NOT NULL,
	[LastModifiedBy] [nvarchar](255) NOT NULL,
	[LastModifiedDate] [datetime] NOT NULL,


